@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "Fcitx5\nInputContext" as IC
participant "Fcitx frontend" as Frontend
participant "目标应用" as App

Addon -> Addon : Final(segment_id, text)
Addon -> Addon : 查找 segment_id 的目标 InputContext

alt 目标存在且 hasFocus()
  Addon -> IC : commitString(text)
  IC -> Frontend : commit
  Frontend -> App : 插入 UTF-8 文本
else 目标不存在 / 已失焦 / 无焦点
  Addon -> Addon : 不注入\n文本保留在 daemon / TUI
end

note over Frontend
  Wayland：text-input-v3 commit_string
  XWayland / X11：XIM_COMMIT
  其他：Fcitx 对应的 frontend
end note
@enduml
